Having predicted that the Imperial Fleet would stick to the back-turn advancement strategy...

00:25:10.120 --> 00:25:13.820
...Ashbey attacks their rear flank
by leading a partisan fleet himself.

00:25:13.820 --> 00:25:17.950
As a result of that dramatic tactic, the
Imperial Fleet went into a total collapse...

00:25:17.950 --> 00:25:20.830
...and the battle ended up as a
decisive victory for the Alliance Fleet.

00:25:20.830 --> 00:25:22.480
But at that moment...

00:25:22.480 --> 00:25:27.400
